/**
 * Builds the plugin catalogue for the website:
 *   - plugins/catalog.json                  machine-readable index of every plugin
 *   - .claude-plugin/marketplace.json       Claude Code / Cowork marketplace manifest
 *   - plugins/index.html (marked regions)   pre-rendered cards, stats and JSON-LD
 *
 * Sources:
 *   plugins/engineers/*   24 engineer-role plugins (generated by generate-engineer-plugins.js)
 *   plugins/anthropic/*   vendored anthropics/knowledge-work-plugins (Apache-2.0)
 *
 * All text is HTML-escaped at render time; the page never uses innerHTML on catalogue data.
 */
